## 2025

### Featured on the *Communications Biology* homepage (August 12–20, 2025)
Our paper, *Interpretable and Integrative Single-Cell Multiomics Analysis with scMKL*, was featured on the *Communications Biology* homepage along with the submitted cover art.  
![Screenshot of journal homepage](/images/scMKL_screenshot.png)

---

### Presentation: *Interpretable Machine Learning for Multi-omics in Cancer*  
**Knight Cancer Institute Science Day**, Portland, USA (2025)  
Presented work on the development and application of interpretable machine learning models for integrative cancer analysis.  
![Presentation at KCI Science Day](/images/kci_research_day.jpeg)

---

### Service: Abstract Review Committee Member  
**The Early Detection of Cancer Conference**, Portland, USA (2025)  
Served on the Abstract Review Committee for the 2025 Early Detection of Cancer Conference, contributing to the scientific review and selection process.  
[Conference Book (PDF)](https://www.earlydetectionresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025-EDx-Conf_v6.pdf)

---

