## 2024

### Presentation: *Spatial Analysis of Androgen Receptor’s Role in Prostate Cancer Across Multiple Scales*  
**3rd Annual Spatial Biology Summit**, Stanford, USA (2024)  
Presented analyses of androgen receptor spatial signaling in prostate cancer across multiple length scales.  
